            "step": 0.001,
            "round": 0.001,
            "tooltip": "Reference Strength. 1.0 keeps the reference/keyframe latents exactly as encoded (strongest adherence to the source image); lower values blend noise in, loosening identity and framing in exchange for motion freedom. Stock default is 0.999. No effect without a keyframe or reference image (T2V)."
          }
        ]
      },
      "optional": {
        "audio_cond_noise_aug": [
